{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_4000_place", "source_sha256": "3d44ee6c2347f1b74d7e4433ec4f514493709abf46436b561e0c953429446f25", "ja": "収録スタジオ袖", "zh": "摄影棚侧边", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_4001_009rit", "source_sha256": "6ea30b09abb505900d9b43be4adeef603054d89b29522fdaf8d5de2900308c85", "ja": "ふっふっふ。この手の番組は私、大好きなんです♪\nあぁもう、早く収録始まらないかしら。", "zh": "呵呵呵，我最喜欢这类型的节目了♪\n啊～能不能快点开始录影呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_4002_p", "source_sha256": "1e97d44a6603534e5672592d9c2d4e1c3cb6f2521c1f9d7039e93fe4f1364217", "ja": "やる気だな、律子。そんなに待ち遠しいなら、\nヒマつぶしに……俺にクイズでも出題してみるか？", "zh": "真有干劲呢，律子。既然这么等不及的话，\n就当作是打发时间……你来出题让我回答如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_4003_009rit", "source_sha256": "1c18681e48a5f11c86a79f0e4369d35e4be404ae9e21b8a5e9b1eb0316374a55", "ja": "おっ、いいですね～！\nそれじゃあ、ええと……そうだ！", "zh": "哦，不错呢～！\n那么，呃……对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_4004_009rit", "source_sha256": "23c31d47ad6fd2c2832699b31c81538fc4786dbc992009f498665fc008ee2b60", "ja": "私がたまたま読んだ本からの問題です♪\n私たち、アイドルの語源は、なんでしょう～？", "zh": "这个问题出自我凑巧读到的书♪\n请问我们偶像（Idol）的语源是什么呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_4005_p", "source_sha256": "dfa08aedfef6047aa4f51aa8f5ccc4e7006e62f121e67eee25b5d608d6391c52", "ja": "へぇ、アイドルの語源か。それは……", "zh": "嘿……Idol的语源啊，那是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_4006", "source_sha256": "85334170f01519461aa3223ca4166a3eeac0e9e1abd19ad70ce45fe044b0b798", "ja": "ギリシャ語の『見る』", "zh": "希腊语的『看』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_4007", "source_sha256": "3a673220f13a06893dc7d89e8966561fdab78d6c405d27b58d6cbf33e55bfc4b", "ja": "ラテン語の『舞台』", "zh": "拉丁语的『舞台』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_4008", "source_sha256": "bea455bdaad8df67c639d1f663d705787f7071c18ac2e1b69b636068f1ebeaea", "ja": "日本語の『あ井戸る』", "zh": "国语的『啊疑窦噜』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_4100_p", "source_sha256": "129422b36ae04fe3c10d5d98ab37044a4ac5de69a1c05d2ee2c15618e93ea6ac", "ja": "確か、ギリシャ語の「見る」が語源じゃなかったっけ？", "zh": "我记得语源应该是希腊语的「看」吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_4101_009rit", "source_sha256": "3415e5ebcb4740b90fae5eaf30d8701558c02be76a9458b8d43ba9174d47baf5", "ja": "正解～♪　これは{$P$}殿には、\nちょっと簡単すぎたみたいね。ふふっ♪", "zh": "答对了～♪这题对{$P$}阁下\n似乎有点太简单了呢，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_4200_p", "source_sha256": "dfc5671cb68f61e52f7d0ed1d985738c6dc9f1bdcbe506ebee190fd0c19fabd1", "ja": "ラテン語の「舞台」だったような……違ったっけ？", "zh": "好像是拉丁语的「舞台」吧……不对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_4201_009rit", "source_sha256": "5bb898095380f4675003def1d6c13f837a756d53f9dfea8fd984160a4344ca3c", "ja": "ブブー！　でも、それって確か、シナリオの語源じゃ\nなかったかな……。ふふっ、意外と博識ですね♪", "zh": "答错了！不过，我记得那好像是Scenario的语源吧……\n呵呵，没想到你很博学呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_4300_p", "source_sha256": "481fe4dabc6cf17031ad6a1f6b3d0169834a040e3bd6421c4d06e4c4cb95e170", "ja": "日本語の「あ井戸る」が語源……とか？\n「あ、井戸……るぅ！」みたいな？", "zh": "语源是国语的『啊疑窦噜』……之类的？\n「啊，疑窦……噜！」像这样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_4301_009rit", "source_sha256": "e7806533aa6944cda204f4e6822c1c0e1a81de28df62db24d43a25dfa861e228", "ja": "そんなわけないじゃないですか。だいたい最後の\n「るぅ！」ってなんです？　あなたのなき声ですか？", "zh": "那怎么可能啊，再说最后的「噜！」是什么？\n是你的叫声吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
